1
00:00:43,039 --> 00:00:44,119
We finally meet.

2
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,079
Too bad we just met,

3
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:48,079
and now you have to die.

4
00:00:48,719 --> 00:00:49,280
What?

5
00:00:50,359 --> 00:00:51,320
Are you going to kill me too,

6
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,960
just like you killed my mother,

7
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,520
Fang Lan?

8
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:57,399
She knew too much.

9
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,320
If she didn't die,

10
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:00,920
I would have.

11
00:01:01,439 --> 00:01:02,799
So I killed her.

12
00:01:03,439 --> 00:01:04,959
I was planning to wait until you got home

13
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:05,959
to finish you both off.

14
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,400
It was your mother...

15
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,120
She pleaded desperately.

16
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,480
She got on her knees and begged me

17
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:13,640
to spare your life.

18
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,480
You're not the only killer.

19
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,400
There's Chen Yanzhi, too.

20
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:20,280
He helped you kill,

21
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:22,439
helped you destroy evidence,

22
00:01:23,079 --> 00:01:24,159
and helped you evade the charges.

23
00:01:24,159 --> 00:01:25,519
Even if he did, so what?

24
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,799
You don't even know who I am.

25
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:29,879
And even before you find out,

26
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,799
your life is already in my hands.

27
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:34,760
I might as well tell you:

28
00:01:35,799 --> 00:01:37,599
the commemorative coins given out at this event

29
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,359
are laced with deadly poison.

30
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,760
And those fools...

31
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:42,560
took every single one.

32
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,680
Tell me,

33
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:46,079
after you're dead,

34
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,400
will the police have what it takes

35
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,920
to save anyone when disaster strikes?

36
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,000
Or rather...

37
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:54,200
will they just watch helplessly

38
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,000
as everyone

39
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,719
plunges straight into hell?

40
00:01:58,879 --> 00:02:00,079
Even so, we're still better than you.

41
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:02,359
At least we can hold our heads high

42
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:03,319
and walk in the sunlight.

43
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:04,799
Unlike you,

44
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,240
living under someone else's identity,

45
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,759
never able to be yourself.

46
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:12,120
You're truly pathetic.

47
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,919
You deserve to die!

48
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:32,680
I thought you knew me so well!

49
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:37,919
What are you doing? Let go of me!

50
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:39,560
Isn't this just a murder mystery game?

51
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,599
Who told you to say those things to me?

52
00:02:43,759 --> 00:02:44,800
Ah, okay, okay!

53
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,319
Someone found me on social media

54
00:02:46,319 --> 00:02:47,439
and transferred me 5,000 yuan

55
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:48,960
to play a role as instructed,

56
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,800
and join this immersive murder mystery!

57
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:53,080
You just do whatever he tells you?

58
00:02:53,159 --> 00:02:54,479
If he told you to kill someone, would you?

59
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:55,800
He said...

60
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,080
He said there were safety measures!

61
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:58,879
It was just an act!

62
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:04,879
Everyone, don't panic!

63
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:05,919
We're the police.

64
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,400
We'll keep everyone safe.

65
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,800
Please line up and hand over

66
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,719
the souvenirs you received today.

67
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,800
They contain toxic substances.

68
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,199
Do not eat them under any circumstances!

69
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,599
We caught someone,

70
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:46,840
but it's not Lin Anzhe.

71
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,560
He can't have gotten far.

72
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,279
Sis.

73
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,879
Your leg is healed.

74
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,160
That's wonderful!

75
00:04:51,839 --> 00:04:52,319
Yeah.

76
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:54,480
I even kept it from my boyfriend,

77
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,439
just to surprise everyone.

78
00:04:58,079 --> 00:04:58,560
Wow.

79
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,160
Never knew you had this kind of kink.

80
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:05,759
It was for a part-time gig,

81
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:07,040
so the requirements were a bit unusual.

82
00:05:07,439 --> 00:05:08,399
I had to cross-dress as a girl.

83
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,399
You guys aren't going to

84
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,800
arrest me just because

85
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,000
I dressed as a woman, are you?

86
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,920
Living under someone else's identity...

87
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,399
must be exhausting, right?

88
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,160
Sis,

89
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,800
I have no idea what you're talking about.

90
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,360
What do you think?

91
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,040
Using a Bluetooth earpiece,

92
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,839
you had someone feed you the answers.

93
00:05:40,879 --> 00:05:42,560
Too bad nothing you hoped for happened.

94
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,120
Aren't you disappointed?

95
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,000
It was just for a part-time gig!

96
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:50,199
I was only following orders

97
00:05:50,319 --> 00:05:51,759
to direct someone over Bluetooth.

98
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:54,399
I thought it was just a murder mystery game.

99
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,399
If I'd known

100
00:05:56,759 --> 00:05:58,000
someone wanted to kill you, Sis,

101
00:05:58,279 --> 00:05:59,519
I never would've done it!

102
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,079
Never!

103
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:02,079
Don't overestimate your clever tricks.

104
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,959
The illegitimate son of the Shen family...

105
00:06:04,279 --> 00:06:04,920
Lin Anzhe.

106
00:06:06,079 --> 00:06:07,720
You decided to kill me to spite Shen Yu,

107
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:10,120
and found a college student with a totally

108
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,439
different height and look as your decoy.

109
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:12,079
A decoy?

110
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,879
An illegitimate son?

111
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,920
You sure love inventing a backstory for me.

112
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:25,160
The Shen family's illegitimate son has asthma.

113
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,279
You probably know that too.

114
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:29,600
I had one of Shen Yu's men tail you.

115
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,519
He said

116
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,959
he often saw you holding

117
00:06:32,959 --> 00:06:34,000
a small canister and inhaling from it.

118
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,319
Why would that be?

119
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:38,560
My guess is,

120
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,560
it's because you have asthma.

121
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,480
Am I right?

122
00:06:46,639 --> 00:06:47,839
You're right about everything.

123
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,199
I really am Shen Haotian's

124
00:06:50,199 --> 00:06:51,240
illegitimate son.

125
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,160
My mother was a dancer.

126
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,160
Shen Haotian looked down on her,

127
00:06:55,399 --> 00:06:56,920
yet she secretly gave birth to me,

128
00:06:57,399 --> 00:06:58,480
thinking she could climb to the top.

129
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,160
In the end, though,

130
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,519
Shen Haotian only took me away.

131
00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:04,759
Thirteen years ago,

132
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,879
why did you kill Shen Xian?

133
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:11,920
Because I hate Shen Haotian!

134
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,439
I hate the Shen family!

135
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,879
I hate everyone!

136
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:16,040
Including you!
